# config/flatpaks.list — Flatpak source of truth (v0.1)
# IDEA: Flatpak has no native --from-file (see flatpak#5186), so this file + ensure-flatpaks.sh IS the declarative layer.
# - Format: <remote> <app-id> [branch]. `#` = comment.
# - Add a line -> `luci sync` installs it. Remove a line -> `luci sync --prune` uninstalls it.
# - System-wide (flatpak system) by default for multi-user OS feel; user flag supported via --user in script.
# - Prefer Flatpak for: browsers, IDEs, media, Blender (isolation), ComfyUI — keeps Arch base clean.
# - Do NOT put here: Hyprland, portals, lock, drivers (must stay pacman, PAM/GL traps, see ADR-0001).

# <remote> <app-id> [branch]
flathub org.mozilla.firefox stable
flathub md.obsidian.Obsidian stable
flathub com.obsproject.Studio stable
flathub org.blender.Blender stable
flathub com.visualstudio.code stable
flathub org.keepassxc.KeePassXC stable
# flathub com.brave.Browser stable  # ALT to firefox, decide in grill
# flathub org.videolan.VLC stable
